# INVWINST.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the status bar's
# help panel.  ALT-F opens the File menu on Log out, whose help the panel
# shows, then DOWN Exit's; RIGHT opens the Items menu on Browse by ID,
# six more the Record menu on Open, one more the View menu on Pane
# beside the list, DOWN there Refresh, and RIGHT the Help menu on Help on
# this screen.  ESC leaves the bar alone highlighted, the panel empty,
# and ESC again closes the menus.  ALT-SPACE opens the system menu,
# whose entries have no help, and ESC twice closes it and the bar.  SHIFT-F10 opens the
# Record menu as a pop-up on its first entry, Open, and ESC closes it.
# At level 1 Edit, grayed, still shows its help.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINST.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/framchk.py checks
# it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S ITEMS
K ALT-F
S FILE
K DOWN
S EXIT
K RIGHT
S ITEMMENU
K RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT RIGHT
S RECORD
K RIGHT
S VIEWMENU
K DOWN
S REFRESH
K RIGHT
S HELPMENU
K ESC
S BAR
K ESC
S CLOSED
K ALT-SPACE
S SYSMENU
K ESC ESC
S SYSCLOSE
K SHIFT-F10
S POPUP
K ESC
S POPCLOSE
K ALT-F L STAB
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER
K ALT-C
S RREC
K DOWN
S RGRAYED
K ESC ESC
S RCLOSED
K ALT-F X
